ection-Over-Union as the evaluation metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":288796,"global_rank":28160,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5884},{"name":"sarahwallingbell/ccf_slice_registration","owner":"sarahwallingbell","html_url":"https://github.com/sarahwallingbell/ccf_slice_registration","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288795,"global_rank":28163,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5885},{"name":"coderholic/MendeleyClient","owner":"coderholic","html_url":"https://github.com/coderholic/MendeleyClient","stars":17,"forks":4,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"Python client for the Mendeley open api","topics":[],"score":288789,"global_rank":28167,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5886},{"name":"rmenon1008/mockupgen-templates","owner":"rmenon1008","html_url":"https://github.com/rmenon1008/mockupgen-templates","stars":6,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288788,"global_rank":28168,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5887},{"name":"awslabs/aws-greengrass-labs-sitewise-stream-publisher","owner":"awslabs","html_url":"https://github.com/awslabs/aws-greengrass-labs-sitewise-stream-publisher","stars":4,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"i